stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Acquired: Matched attachment bytes copied
    Acquired --> Refused: PDF header or tail missing, or image type refused
    Acquired --> Admitted: Byte detector admits PDF or Office
    Admitted --> Pending: Archive or filing fails
    Admitted --> FiledPDF: Filing stored or existing PDF
    Admitted --> FiledOffice: Filing stored or existing Office document
    FiledPDF --> Observed: Successful receipt has positive PDF count and expected full SHA
    FiledOffice --> Held: PDF count absent
    Refused --> Held: PDF count absent
    Pending --> Held: Failed receipt or PDF count absent
